<title>FINLAND: Metsa-Serla 1996 results breakdown.</title>
<headline>Metsa-Serla 1996 results breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest industry group Metsa-Serla Oy on Monday published the following breakdown of its full-year 1996 results (million markka):</p>
<p>				 1-12     9-12     5-8     1-4    1-12</p>
<p>				 '96	'96	'96     '96    '95</p>
<p>TURNOVER</p>
<p>  Paper division	  4,297    1,585   1,273   1,439   2,974</p>
<p>  Packaging division    4,830    1,635   1,570   1,625   4,142</p>
<p>  Marketing		 1,483	521     458     504   1,390</p>
<p>  Tissue division	 1,843	621     594     628   1,758</p>
<p>  Pulp and resources    3,856    1,322   1,155   1,379   4,774</p>
<p>  Chemical division	 704	198     241     265     615</p>
<p>  Inter-segment sales  -2,342     -737    -668    -937  -2,332</p>
<p> TOTAL		     14,671    5,145   4,623   4,903  13,321</p>
<p>OPERATING PROFIT</p>
<p>  Paper and board	    10	-16     -27	53     194</p>
<p>  Packaging division	561	199     184     178     526</p>
<p>  Marketing		    45	 17	12	16	62</p>
<p>  Tissue division	   161	 54	60	47     102</p>
<p>  Pulp and resources	220	102     -98     216   1,473</p>
<p>  Chemical division	 102	 30	34	38	42</p>
<p>  Other			-197	-59     -63     -75     -12</p>
<p> TOTAL			  902	327     102     473   2,387 @</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
